{c: Verse 1}
[D#]Naam gum jaayegaa
[D#]Chehara ye badal jayegaa
[D#]Meri aavaaz [A#]hi pahachaan hai
[A#]Gar [D#]yaad rahe
[D#]Vaqt ke [A#]sitam kam [D#]hasi nahi
[D#]Aaj hai [A#]yahaan kal [D#]kahi nahi
[D#]Vaqt se [G#]bhare agar [D#]mil gaye kahi
[D#]Meri aavaaz [A#]hi pahachaan hai
[A#]Gar [D#]yaad rahe
[D#]Jo guzar [A#]gai kal [D#]ki baat thi
[D#]Umr to [A#]nahi ek [D#]aas thi
[D#]Raat kaa [G#]silaa agar [D#]phir mile kahi
[D#]Meri aavaaz [A#]hi pahachaan hai
[A#]Gar [D#]yaad rahe
[D#] [ A#] [D#],        Din dhale jahaan raat paas ho
[D#] [ A#] [D#],        Zindagi ki raah unchi kar chalo
[D#] [ G#] [D#],        Yaad aaye gar kabhi ji udaas ho
